# The bastion (log 2026-07-31): the community Impossible meta as one arm.
# The wall walks halfway out -- on a bridge map, the choke -- and holds,
# every third structure a repair bay; the heavy horde masses behind it and
# the enemy funnels into standing fire. The bridge probes measured the
# second-deepest Impossible dent from a wall that was not even AT the
# bridge; this one is.

